<BaseLayout title="About | Launch Baseball"><main><section class="hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Why I coach</p><h1>I don't need this.<br/>I love this.</h1></div></section><section class="paper"><div class="container copy"><p class="lead">I coach because I love watching the moment a player understands something they could not see five minutes earlier.</p><p>I was a smaller, weaker, younger player. Without a strong foundation, I could never have competed as far as I did.</p><p>Years later, I watched players reach high school without the basic principles they needed. Launch Baseball exists to organize those principles, explain why they matter, and give players the tools to continue improving.</p><p>The goal is not to make a player dependent on endless lessons. The goal is to help the player understand the game well enough to keep moving forward.</p><a class="text-link" href="/learn">Start with the foundation →</a></div></section></main><style>.hero{padding:8rem 0 7rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 25%,rgba(211,41,47,.23),transparent 28%),linear-gradient(135deg,var(--navy),var(--navy2))}.hero h1{margin:.5rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(4rem,9vw,8rem);text-transform:uppercase}.paper{padding:7rem 0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)}.copy{max-width:780px}.copy p{font-size:1.15rem;color:#46525d}.copy .lead{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,3rem);color:var(--ink);font-weight:900;line-height:1.12}</style></BaseLayout>
